      "id": "nantang-li-yu-baoyi-huang-palace-entry",
      "title": "幼时被纳入后宫",
      "summary": "原书记边镐得黄氏入后宫，当时仅数岁；这一阶段不写已被临幸。",
      "year": null,
      "sortOrder": 1,
      "precision": "undated",
      "sourceDate": "边镐入长沙／下湖南时；未独记黄氏年月",
      "phase": "uncertain",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v018",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v018-p10",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "04cb5df7880f538590dd2623945bae7126d4a049346db91599401a0b874ced9c",
          "excerpt": "邊鎬入長沙，得黃氏，甫數歲，奇其貌，內後宮。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "nantangma-v006",
          "paragraphId": "nantangma-v006-p10",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "80d5335ca9f688fc5f36e50a348c770225aa8a33a38e0a0dce58754533a36d18",
          "excerpt": "邊鎬下湖南得黄氏甫數歳竒其貌内後宫"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
